 212:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcsample.c ****  * Downsample pixel values of a single component.
 213:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcsample.c ****  * This version handles the common case of 2:1 horizontal and 1:1 vertical,
