 215:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcsample.c ****  *
 216:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcsample.c ****  * A note about the "bias" calculations: when rounding fractional values to
 217:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcsample.c ****  * integer, we do not want to always round 0.5 up to the next integer.
 218:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcsample.c ****  * If we did that, we'd introduce a noticeable bias towards larger values.
 219:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcsample.c ****  * Instead, this code is arranged so that 0.5 will be rounded up or down at
 220:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcsample.c ****  * alternate pixel locations (a simple ordered dither pattern).
 221:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcsample.c ****  */
